      "name": "Sig Sauer MCX VIRTUS multi carlibre rifle",
      "slug": "sig-sauer-mcx-virtus-multi-carlibre-rifle",
      "teaser": "Now you can find another second generation SIG MCX for fight",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/1897.png",
      "downloads": 19562,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Tired of cosplaying the 2010s CAG oprators with shitty MCX gen1, it’s time to become a stylish shooter on range.</strong></p>\n<p>The mod adds MCX Virtus and bunchs of attachments to custonmize you fighting style.</p>\n<p>Not all the attachments have displayed above, because it’s from virson 1.0, you can find more on latest version. Including combned zenitco PT-1, PT-3 stock, Lancer L5AWM in transparency and MI handguard in 11.5in(I know it should be 12.5-inchs in reality).</p>\n<p>Sources &amp; Cradits:</p>\n<p>MCX VIRTUS:<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/sig-sauer-mcx-virtus-assault-rifle\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/gun/sig-sauer-mcx-virtus-assault-rifle</a></p>\n<p>Midwest handguards:<br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/other/mi-mcx-handguard\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.cgtrader.com/3d-models/military/other/mi-mcx-handguard</a></p>\n<p>Lancer L5AWM:<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/military/gun/lancer-l5awm-30-round-m4-magazine\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.cgtrader.com/free-3d-models/military/gun/lancer-l5awm-30-round-m4-magazine</a></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/23752-mighty-condor/?highlight=mig\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Mighty_Condor:   </a></strong></p>\n<p>Original author of code strutcure, that’s the mod’s life depend on.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/29815-pettan/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><strong>PETTAN:<br />\n</strong></a>Author of Alice, and offer trully needful advices.<br />\n</p>\n<p>And everyone who recommend, finding bugs, post opinions, or just download and enjoy the mod.</p>\n",
